WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Narrator: A dry answer: no.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.700
Narrator: No reason given. The visitor stands confused. He does not know where to go.

3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.300
Narrator: And the third: saying no.

4
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.900
Narrator: Same rule, different experience.
